ntale + Lignes droites","coachAdvice":"Le footing, c'est le moment de courir relâché(e), d'essayer d'effacer les petites tensions naturelles que tu pourrais avoir dans les épaules par exemple ! Souffle, sens les épaules se relâcher et descendre. Idéalement, elles devraient toujours être à ce niveau ! ","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF_LD","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance_with_straight_lines","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_17","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":326,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":17,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":3,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"LD","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"VO2max","value":211,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"vo2max","context":"intensity","perception":"very-high"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"Recup_Indif_0.75","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Endurance confort","value":339,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-confort","context":"pace","perception":"easy"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":2,"weekDate":1794182400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionTrailV2ExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":1200},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1020,"pace":{"value":326}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":211}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":339}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":211}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":339}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":211}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":339}}]},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2SessionWithStats","sport":"trailV2","name":"Competition_XL","description":"Le mot du jour : gestion. La course sera suffisamment longue pour que chaque erreur de rythme se paie plus tard. Prends le temps de trouver ton allure dès le départ et n'hésite pas à marcher dans les montées les plus raides si cela te permet d'économiser ton énergie. Pense à boire et à t'alimenter régulièrement, sans attendre les premiers signes de fatigue. Aujourd'hui, ce n'est pas le plus rapide au départ qui sera récompensé, mais celui ou celle qui saura rester efficace jusqu'au bout. Sois patient(e), régulier(ère) et profite du terrain.","displayName":"Jour de course","coachAdvice":"L'équipe CAMPUS te souhaite bon courage pour ta compétition ! On est tous derrière toi :)","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"Competition","trainingCategory":"trail_competition","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"course","value":552,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z1","abstract":true,"slug":"race","context":"intensity","perception":"target"},"durations":[{"value":38640,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":5,"trainingIndex":3,"weekDate":1794182400000,"status":"todo","nutritionTraining":{"_id":"6a68a5190462290c63b4cf2c","userId":"642ab60364e5867bee895c04","weekDate":1794182400000,"sessionIndex":3,"choRecommendation":6,"formSuggestions":["semi-liquid","liquid"],"recipeOptions":{"1":{"homemade":[],"commercial":[]},"2":{"homemade":[[{"datoId":"fV5sxS6dTOmJgqP6qnmqoA","name":"Velouté de tomates spécial effort","form":"liquid","info":{"quantity":{"value":5350,"metric":"mL"},"cho":{"value":321,"metric":"g"},"sodium":{"value":21935,"metric":"mg"}}},{"datoId":"OZbi5vJqRs6phchCZtARQQ","name":"Gel énergétique","form":"semi-liquid","info":{"quantity":{"value":3.5,"metric":"item"},"cho":{"value":85.4,"metric":"g